<title>UK: LaFarge sets two 1.0 bln Ffr bonds, 7 and 10-year.</title>
<headline>LaFarge sets two 1.0 bln Ffr bonds, 7 and 10-year.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two bonds were announced by lead manager BNP.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LAFARGE SA</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    04.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.364   PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.7	 REOFFER    99.064    SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.60	MATURITY    04.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.836   PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.486    SPREAD	+33 BP</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K) FIVE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED FEB 2004 AND APR 2004 OATS -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
